---
import Offering from '../layouts/Offering.astro';
---
<Offering offering="growth">
  <section class="block" slot="after-items">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><div><span class="label accent">A design sprint</span><h2>From zero to an MVP</h2></div></div>
      <div class="prose" style="margin-bottom:32px"><p>Timelines flex with the problem. A sprint can run for days or for weeks. This is how it ran for Beiersdorf, against a startup competitor that was already in the market.</p></div>
      <div class="timeline">
        <div><span class="label accent">Sprint</span><strong>Two weeks</strong><p>From a blank page to an MVP and a working website.</p></div>
        <div><span class="label accent">Launch</span><strong>Two days later</strong><p>The full store live, selling around 8,000 personalized options.</p></div>
        <div><span class="label accent">Production</span><strong>Four weeks later</strong><p>Manufacturing started on real orders.</p></div>
      </div>
      <p class="label fig-note">Beiersdorf</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Offering>